---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';import casda from '../../assets/img/casda.webp';import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';import {site} from '../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Casda Network &mdash; Gyzenn Community" description="Casda Network, server Minecraft Java dan Bedrock yang sedang dikembangkan." image="/assets/img/casda.webp"><div class="container page"><article class="card server"><Image src={casda} alt="Casda Network" widths={[480,800,1200]} sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" format="webp"/><div class="body"><span class="status">Dalam pengembangan</span><h1>Casda Network</h1><p>Casda Network sedang dalam tahap pengembangan. Berbagai sistem, mode, dan fitur server sedang dipersiapkan sebelum resmi dibuka untuk publik.</p><dl><div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>Java + Bedrock</dd></div><div><dt>Versi</dt><dd>Akan diumumkan</dd></div><div><dt>IP</dt><dd>Akan diumumkan</dd></div></dl><h2>Rencana mode</h2><ul class="modes">{['Survival','PvP Arena','Economy','Community'].map(m=><li>{m}<span>Segera</span></li>)}</ul><a class="btn discord" href={site.links.discordCasda} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kabari saya lewat Discord</a></div></article></div></BaseLayout>
<style>.server{overflow:hidden;color:var(--ink)}.server>img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover}.body{padding:18px}.status{padding:5px 10px;border-radius:99px;background:#fff0d3;color:#674500;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.body h1{margin:12px 0;font-size:30px}.body p{color:var(--muted)}dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}dl div{padding:10px;background:#e7f3fc;border-radius:10px}dt{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}dd{margin:2px 0 0;font-weight:700}.body h2{font-size:20px}.modes{list-style:none;padding:0}.modes li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d3e0e9}.modes span{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}@media(min-width:768px){.server{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:start}.server>img{height:100%}.body{padding:28px}dl{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}</style>
